  Slug: perpetual-infusions-mutagenist
  DisplayName: Perpetual Infusions (Mutagenist)
  IconPath: icons/consumables/potions/potion-jug-corked-skull-poison-brown-green.webp
  Description: You have learned how to create perpetual alchemical infusions that
    can provide a near-infinite supply of certain simple items. You gain the ability
    to create two 1st-level alchemical items using @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Quick
    Alchemy] without spending a batch of infused reagents. The items you can select
    depend on your research field and must be in your formula book. Each time you
    gain a level, you can swap any number of your perpetual infusions with other
    eligible infusions. Choose two 1st-level mutagens.
